{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/08088410f387d6d1dbb5db754db4d195.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Demon Lord plunged the world into fear, it was the hero Liese who rose up to restore peace. Years after the Demon Lord's defeat, Liese hears rumors of a fortress appearing near the city of Wes in the Demon Lord's old territory. Liese arrives to find the city under constant threat from monsters, and it's up to her to save Wes before it falls to the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/b17d440ae194f93dfa5f660a3cfb19ca.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off monsters with a stress-free action RPG system that doesn't require any grinding to advance. Use items and Liese's finishing move to defeat powerful enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/12974833966225b352a50bc70ad26918.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/7e5b83f139a08b598bc58c99a19bfdaf.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/539ae6d9c029078d85fb132e38ac56a4.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Action RPG Gameplay</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around and swing your sword as you cut down enemies in this action-based RPG. There's no need to wait for turn-based battles when you can hack and slash through enemies at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531960?t=1754107209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531960?t=1754107209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/2b70729a0f1c0dcd1cc72618ff38c6541edde779/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754107209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/2b70729a0f1c0dcd1cc72618ff38c6541edde779/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754107209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/08088410f387d6d1dbb5db754db4d195.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Demon Lord plunged the world into fear, it was the hero Liese who rose up to restore peace. Years after the Demon Lord's defeat, Liese hears rumors of a fortress appearing near the city of Wes in the Demon Lord's old territory. Liese arrives to find the city under constant threat from monsters, and it's up to her to save Wes before it falls to the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/b17d440ae194f93dfa5f660a3cfb19ca.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off monsters with a stress-free action RPG system that doesn't require any grinding to advance. Use items and Liese's finishing move to defeat powerful enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/12974833966225b352a50bc70ad26918.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/7e5b83f139a08b598bc58c99a19bfdaf.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/extras/539ae6d9c029078d85fb132e38ac56a4.avif?t=1754107209\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Action RPG Gameplay</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around and swing your sword as you cut down enemies in this action-based RPG. There's no need to wait for turn-based battles when you can hack and slash through enemies at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mofuya"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531960/902f5fc8ad17d027b93cc30b573d8dca99bd7de6/header.jpg?t=1754107209","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Kagura Games and Mofuya, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531960/69477072/574502604927c852f9bca0f3a28e375cd9343e20/1752784131/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752858546","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531960/69477072/574502604927c852f9bca0f3a28e375cd9343e20/1752784131/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752858546","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531960/69477072/5745026